dsh-everything-file
===================

Plugin code and the bundled NTFS indexer: MIT (see LICENSE).

bin/MftIndexer.cs and bin/dsh-mft-indexer.exe
  Original work for this plugin. The indexer reads each fixed NTFS volume's
  MFT through FSCTL_ENUM_USN_DATA, keeps the names in memory, and answers
  substring queries over the named pipe \\.\pipe\dsh-mft-index. It runs as the
  dsh-mft-index Windows service (LocalSystem) because opening a volume handle
  requires elevation.

No third-party components
  The package contains no vendor library, client DLL, wrapper executable, or
  copied source from another file-search product. Every backend is either this
  project's own code (the MFT service and the portable walk index) or the
  operating system's own tooling (Spotlight's `mdfind` on macOS). An earlier
  version bundled an optional client library for a third-party index; it was
  removed in 0.4.3 together with every code path that used it.
